  data: {
    LLM: "No trumps. Player to dealer's right leads first. Any card may be led; others must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins trick; winner leads to next. It is illegal to lead coins in the first trick. The Pita (Ace of Coins) cannot be discarded in the first trick if unable to follow suit.",
    Player: "No trumps. Player to dealer's right leads first. Any card may be led; others must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins trick; winner leads to next. It is illegal to lead coins in the first trick. The Pita (Ace of Coins) cannot be discarded in the first trick if unable to follow suit.",
    objective: 'Take at least one point but avoid taking the most points. Players who take no points or the most points score penalty points called busche.',
