      'Scoring example: Penalty points called busche accumulate from deal to deal. Card points in tricks are converted into busche based on how many points each player has and whether anyone took no points or the most points. Over several deals, the player with the lowest total busche wins the match; players taking no points or the most card points in a deal gain busche according to the Busca schedule..',
